<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 21.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  Cattle	 Calves    Hogs</p>
<p>Monday     07/21/97  (est)	127,000	6,000     280,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			126,000	6,000     291,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			129,000	7,000     307,000</p>
<p>Previous Day Estimated	Steer and Heifer	Cow and Bull</p>
<p>Friday				  106,000		     25,000</p>
<p>Saturday				 66,000			3,000</p>
<p>USDA revised Saturday's cattle slaughter to 69,000 head from 47,000. The week to date for cattle slaughter was revised to 718,000 head from 696,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
